WEBVTT

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.310
It's not here.

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:37.480
It's not here either.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.250
I never wear neckties.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.710
Why don't you go without one?

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:46.840
Where is it?

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:50.990
Onii-chan, why don't you just give
up being a student teacher?

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.280
Listen, Elis.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.730
Call me Sensei when we're
in the classroom.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.630
Onii-chan, Onii-chan, Onii-chan!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.570
Elis!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.220
Unbelievable.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.740
{}

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.170
Found it!

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:15.180
Moon Gray Sigh

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.010
Maybe this is a little much.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.990
Do you like that?

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:28.930
Is it yummy?

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.310
You're a Nadesico student, aren't you?

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:36.930
You'll be late if you keep
feeding that stray cat.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.500
What's wrong?

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.750
Hey, the academy isn't that way.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.810
That fish sausage was my breakfast.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.680
If I don't eat something, I
can't take my medicine.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:58.620
Do you have a problem with that?

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:06.800
What?

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:14.200
Your student teaching experience
begins today.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.830
Yes.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:18.380
You need not be so nervous.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:21.580
I look forward to seeing what
you can do, Kamikura-sensei.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.810
Sensei...

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.390
You'll be a student teacher for
one month starting today.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:30.760
You will be the homeroom teacher for a
freshman class... and teach an art class.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:31.990
Yes.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:39.360
I'd like to introduce the student
teacher assigned to class 1-A.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:44.300
My name is Kamikura Hiroki. I, uh...

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.570
We'll only be together for
a short time, but...

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:49.750
Sensei, are you going
to a wedding today?

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.670
Oh, about that.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:54.620
I couldn't find my necktie, so...

00:03:56.660 --> 00:04:00.050
You should have your girlfriend
get you a new one.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.190
Huh? Uh, well...

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.120
He doesn't have a girlfriend!

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:15.470
Kamikura-sensei, hurry up
with your introduction!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.790
Uh, it's a pleasure to meet all of you!

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.540
Sheesh.

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.030
I'm not sure which of you is the teacher.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.280
I'm sorry.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.970
Hosen-san is mature for her age.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.420
I have a lot to learn from her as well.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.020
Excuse me.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.300
Good morning, Fujinami-san.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.970
I came to get the handouts I
missed while I was absent.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.370
Oh, hold on.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:04.590
Allow me to introduce you.
He's the student teacher...

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.970
Fujinami Tomoko-san.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.290
She's very sickly.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.430
She was absent quite
a bit until recently.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:21.580
She doesn't seem to have
adjusted to our class.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.400
I can't do enough for her.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.120
I need to keep it together.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.530
Excuse me.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:42.220
Hey.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:43.860
Hey.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.840
Fujinami-san...

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.330
You're teaching her, too?

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:55.190
Yeah, she only ever watches
during PE, though.

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:58.370
She's always disappearing the
second she's out of my sight.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.600
Sounds like a problem child.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.310
Looks like I've got a tough
student from the get go.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:04.930
Listen to you!

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.240
This isn't a game, you know.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.240
I know.

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.390
That necktie doesn't suit you.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.360
What was I supposed to do?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:20.530
This was the only one I had.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:23.650
I'm saying you shouldn't force yourself
to do things you aren't meant to do.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.400
Are you really going to take
the teaching exams?

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:31.540
I'm really serious about it.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.170
I actually enjoyed schoolyard
drama quite a bit.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.590
Then what about painting?

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.110
What are you going to
do about painting?

00:06:45.240 --> 00:06:46.760
That hit the spot!

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:49.920
Hiroki.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.640
Just leave me alone.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.920
I wish I could! But...

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:27.820
I can't see it.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.660
I won't show you.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.170
I can't see it.

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.290
I won't show you.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.100
Listen, I'm your teacher.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:42.840
Wow!

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.780
Looks pretty good.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.600
You've made some unique color choices.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:51.790
Why don't you try adding
some bright color here?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.150
It'll bring your whole painting together.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.110
What a gloomy painting.

00:07:56.110 --> 00:07:58.090
Just like her!

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.530
Hey!

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.100
Stop, Fujinami!

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:27.910
I'm not feeling well, so I'm
going to the nurse's office!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.270
Hey...

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.880
I thought you went to the nurse's office?

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.820
What's your problem?

00:08:58.710 --> 00:08:59.750
What?

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:04.060
I don't have time for a student
teacher's fantasy.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:06.590
Hey, where are you...

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.390
The bathroom.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:15.730
Are you going to follow me to the
girls' bathroom, Kamikura-sensei?

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:30.520
Tomoko-chan sure is funny!

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.620
You're enjoying this, aren't you?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:37.390
I wish she'd give you an
even harder time.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:41.860
Maybe you'll learn your lesson
and give up being a teacher.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.100
I got it.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:52.550
Yes, this is Kamiura.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.040
Yes.

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:56.970
Oh, Kiri.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.210
Do you have a message for me?

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:05.220
No, I just felt like calling.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:06.800
I see.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:11.100
Hiroki?

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.540
Hello? Hello?

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:18.980
Being a teacher's not so easy after all.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.660
What are you talking about?

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.750
What's with the modest attitude?

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.450
I realized I'm still just a kid.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:29.360
I let the students' words
get to me so easily.

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:32.980
I can't watch over them from above.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:35.450
Shouldn't that be a good thing?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.520
Huh?

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.980
Because you're close to your students...

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.920
you can understand them better.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.370
You think so?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.380
Yeah!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.860
Huh, I guess you're right.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.920
Thanks.

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.470
What am I doing encouraging him?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.210
Good morning.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:17.190
I brought you some yummies.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.020
What is this?

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.380
I've got some handouts for you.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.400
Pass them to the people behind you.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.300
Okay.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:53.850
What?

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.250
I'd like to return these.

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:56.730
Huh?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:00.700
I don't want to owe you any favors.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.500
Is that your cat?

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.600
Well...

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.170
Then there's no problem with me
feeding or kissing that cat.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.170
Kiss it? You kissed the cat?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.360
What's wrong with that?

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.510
You'll make the cat sick!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:18.960
Hey!

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:23.190
Forget it! Talking to you makes me sick.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.030
What are you doing?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:30.560
Are you planning to skip class again?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.410
Hey! Let go of...

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:38.340
Hey!

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:40.360
What's wrong? Are you all right?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.920
Hang in there!

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:50.640
I'm sorry I didn't believe you.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.220
Listen...

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:55.070
Just leave me alone.

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.650
Just leave me alone.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:10.090
I wish I could! But...

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.560
So, Sensei, boxers or briefs?

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.790
Why do you want to know?

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.010
You sound like a bunch of geezers.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.740
Onii-chan, over here!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:37.630
I told you not to call me Onii-chan!

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.560
I saw you looking at those girls.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.650
I hope you know you're
starting to get fat!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.510
That's got nothing to do with it.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.320
Fine, you're right.

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.170
Let's go to the cafeteria.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:48.700
I'll pass today.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:49.570
Why?

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.010
The wasteful ghost's about to appear.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.000
This one goes over here...

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.890
How avant-garde.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.340
Superintendent!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.990
Here, have some first flush.

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:42.030
Thank you.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.930
This is Fujinami-san's?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.140
Yes.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:54.870
It's not great, but her heart
is reflected there.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:59.110
I'm worried about her.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.690
There isn't anything I can do, but...

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:16.410
This is a new discovery.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:21.530
Piecing together a torn painting
creates a whole new flavor.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:25.840
I hope you can piece together
Fujinami-san's heart as well.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:29.540
Kamikura-sensei, you're the
only one who can do it!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.490
Excuse me.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.250
All right, gather round!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:58.370
Run ten laps around the track next.

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:11.440
Piece together her heart?

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.970
I'm the only one who can do it?

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:31.470
I've got nothing to do when I
don't have classes to teach.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.790
I can't seem to remember
my students' names.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:52.120
Drawing them helps me remember,
strangely enough.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:59.360
Well, I see Elis every day.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.300
Would you like to draw, too?

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:09.510
Why would I...

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.440
Portraits are pretty difficult.

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.740
Your subject moves.

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:18.270
Well, it might be too difficult for you.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.430
Kiri-sensei! How was my time?

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.430
Sensei...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.220
That's Shimohira?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.030
Isn't her chest bigger than that?

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:43.910
I can't believe how shameless you are!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:47.710
An artist longs for the beauty
of a woman's figure.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.420
You're a sore loser, aren't you?

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:58.290
Thanks...

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.360
What are you doing?

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.910
We're drawing you girls while
learning your names.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:07.880
I see.

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.690
That's Shimohira-san.

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:10.570
Huh?

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:13.360
And this is Ohashi-san.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.760
You can tell?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.280
They've got their unique features.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.510
You can tell this is Ohashi-san
from her eyes...

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.610
Look, this is you, Ohashi-san.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.250
Who, me? No way.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:27.610
Am I really that thin?

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:29.770
It looks just like you.

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:36.490
What are they doing?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.430
Wait, girls...

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.950
Thank you so much, Kamikura-sensei.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.010
It's nothing.

00:19:21.790 --> 00:19:23.740
I'm a little jealous.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:27.910
I've been Fujinami-san's homeroom
teacher for so long...

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.420
Well, I just...

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:34.920
Modesty doesn't suit you,
Kamikura-sensei!

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.200
Kikyo-sensei.

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:43.520
You opened Fujinami-san's
heart with caricatures?

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:45.860
I didn't do anything that big.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:50.400
I guess you haven't forgotten
how to draw.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.500
Maybe you are meant to be a teacher.

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.940
I've still got to tidy up.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.090
Later.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.250
It's a promise, Onii-chan.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:14.360
We're having an A lunch together today.

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:16.090
Okay, okay.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.200
Tomoko-chan, good morning.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.030
Good morning.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:24.730
Good morning.

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:30.740
Here!

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:31.940
Huh?

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:34.100
I drew everyone!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:37.880
Wow, let me see.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.090
This looks just like you!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.020
This is amazing!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.030
Hey, Fujinami!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.200
Why you...

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:58.010
What is it?

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:06.570
You don't have to leave me alone.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.950
Sure, I understand.

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.690
Huh? What was that for?

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:19.120
Hey, wait. Should you be running?

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.990
Hey, Fujinami!

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:13.470
Emerald green is the glittering
color of summer.

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:15.720
That strange color that
perplexes the heart.

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:16.840
By the way, Onii-chan...

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:20.300
why are men drawn to
girls in swimsuits?

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:22.740
That shouldn't require an explanation.

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:25.180
Maybe I'll wear a swimsuit every day.

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:26.880
I'll wear a swimsuit around town.

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.910
I'll wear a swimsuit while in class.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:30.620
I'll wear a swimsuit while I eat.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.300
I'll wear a swimsuit all
the time, everywhere!

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.110
Then you'd just be a weirdo.

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:35.060
You're right.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:37.490
Next episode, “Emerald
Green Temptation.”

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:39.330
Love blooms in summer!
